                "message": "✨ Open the DEVONthink record of a selected citation with Caps+r\n\n- New module sp-cite-open: matches the selected citation against the\n  reference list of the same DEVONthink document, then the BibTeX files\n  (sp-cite-match), then litdb, and opens the record.\n- Hammerspoon: Caps+r in DEVONthink calls it through org-protocol.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8q5mntJU5gbou4xiT",
